      "message": "how about saving those 6 or 7 bits needed from the IO expander into\nFW_CONFIG? that\u0027ll avoid IO expander readiness issue altogether.\n\nwe have a feature request to do that\nhttps://issuetracker.google.com/426139268 AP firmware should use MODULE_ID CBI to define memory type\nbut no one has had time to follow up on it. this may be a good time to do so.",
